# Transparent origami (AoC 2021 Day 13) — plot dots on an unbounded sheet,
# fold it up along y=7 and left along x=5, and read the letter the dots
# form.
#
# Input is x,y (column,row) pairs. Each fold is a per-point reflection, so
# both compose in one Map Each; the Sparse grid keeps only the dots, and
# densifying prints the picture.
#
#   domain challenges/12_origami.domain
Cursed Energy: 12_origami.input
Shikigami: Lines
Cursed Technique: Match Pattern
    Using: "{int},{int}"
    Mode: Each
Cursed Technique: Map Each
    Using: (q) -> point(if item(q, 1) > 7 then 14 - item(q, 1) else item(q, 1), if item(q, 0) > 5 then 10 - item(q, 0) else item(q, 0))
Channeled Energy: Convert To Sparse Grid
    Default: "."
    Mark: "#"
Channeled Energy: Convert To Grid
Reveal: stdout
